      "writtenOn": "2024-10-24T18:10:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Nit: The way the CLs are currently structured, this is not a no-op refactor. I\u0027m not sure if there\u0027s an easy way to restructure them, but ideally, we could separate bug fixes (or introductions) from this refactor. But I think it\u0027s very unlikely that a build of this particular CL will interact with an incoming SVMD version 3.0 or 2.2, so I\u0027m not overly fussed about the CL order.",
